chapter AFP

session MFODL_Syntax = HOL +
  description
    "The parse trees of MonPoly's formula syntax (Surface_Syntax) and their post-processing
     (Surface_Postprocessing), byte strings (Byte_String), and OCaml's escaping of strings in
     MonPoly's messages (String_Escape). The bottom of the logic layer: the formula parser
     produces these parse trees, and the front end (session MFODL_Frontend) converts them into
     the logic's formulas, so neither the logic nor the front end depends on a parser."
  theories
    Surface_Syntax
    Surface_Postprocessing
    String_Escape
    Byte_String
